        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Providing that the Defense Civilian Personnel Advisory Service (DCPAS) approves the body of this agreement, the effective date of the contract shall be thirty-one (31) days after execution by the parties hereto. Both dates (execution and approval) will be made a part of the agreement prior to distribution.",
